001000*****************************************************************
001100*
001200*     T P U R O R D
001300*   THIS PROGRAM IS THE CREATE PURCHASE ORDER
001400*   'MAIN' PROGRAM
001500*
      *****************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C 02/21/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQ #6449
      *C   ADDED NEW FIELDS TO HISTORY DATABASES TO MATCH LIVE
      *C   DATABASES.  CHANGED/RECOMPILED PROGRAM TO USE NEW
      *C   FIELDS.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 05/03/95  WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #95-007
      *C   ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C   ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C   SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 05/15/95  JIM COFFMAN     REQUEST #95-013
      *C   ADDED CODE FOR ISO 9000 REQUEST TO FORCE THE
      *C   BUYER TO REVIEW PURCHASE ORDERS FOR PRINTING
      *C   AND/OR FAXING BEFORE THEY ACTUALLY GET HARD
      *C   COPIED.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 04/29/96  CA YODER        REQ #96-023
      *C   ADDED TWO CHECKS AT THE REQUEST OF JIM FISHEL IN UNC TO
      *C   NOT ALLOW AN INVOICELESS PO TO BE CREATED IF THE PO IS
      *C   A MEMO Z-BILL OR A NON-RECEIVABLE PO.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 07/18/96  CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 05/14/97  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO ACCOUNT FOR FRANCHISE VENDORS/ITEMS.
      *C     1.  ITEMS ON FRANCHISE VENDOR POS CANNOT BE BOTH DIRECT
      *C         DELIVERY AND STOREROOM ITEMS.  THE FIRST ITEM SETS
      *C         THE STANDARD FOR THE REST OF THE ITEMS.
      *C     2.  IF THE ITEMS ARE STOREROOM ITEMS AND THE VENDOR IS A
      *C         FRANCHISE VENDOR, THE PO IS MARKED AS NON-PAYABLE.
      *C     3.  IF THE PO IS NON-PAYABLE, IT CANNOT BE INVOICELESS.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 02/03/98  CA YODER    REQ #97-018
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS FROM DVENDOR
      *C   TO THE PARAMETERS FOR "SPOSINST."
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 02/03/98  CA YODER
      *C   DANVILLE REPORTED THAT THE LAST BUYER/BUYER CODE WAS NOT
      *C   COMING UP CORRECTLY.  CHANGED DPORECDV FILE TO USE LOGICAL
      *C   FILE MCFLCS0903 INSTEAD OF MCFLCS0902.  THIS LF IS BY
      *C   VENDOR CODE & PO DATE, SO THE LAST ONE DATE-WISE WILL
      *C   COME UP.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 02/13/98  CA YODER
      *C   THE INVOICELESS INDICATOR WAS BEING SET TO A Y OR N
      *C   INSTEAD OF X OR " ".  BEFORE THE REWRITE OF DPORECD,
      *C   A CHECK WAS ADDED TO MAKE SURE THE INDICATOR IS A VALID
      *C   VALUE.
      *C------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 01/25/00  JE COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED THE ABILITY TO CHECK MPLTINFO FOR NO SPECIAL
      *C   CHARACTERS ON PRINTS AT SOCIAL CIRCLE'S REQUEST.
DCR01 *C------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *C 02/06/2003  DAN RAUCH        DCR01
DCR01 *C   PREVENT USING BUYER CODE ASSIGNED TO ARIBA BUYER  "ARBA"
DCR02 *C------------------------------------------------------------
DCR02 *C 03/27/2003  DAN RAUCH        DCR02
DCR02 *C  DCR02 - ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
DCR02 *C------------------------------------------------------------
DCR03 *C 06/03/2003  DAN RAUCH        DCR03
DCR03 *C  DCR03 - ADDED LOGIC TO STANDARDIZE FOB CODES FOR TMS
DCR03 *C------------------------------------------------------------
035800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
