           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE VEN-ARG TO VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-O.
           START DVENDOR-O KEY > VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
                   MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
