190800*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-DVENDOR, VEN-ARG.
190900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
191000         IF COND-WORD = 14
191100             GO TO 611-UAD-X
191200         ELSE
