191400             MOVE VEN-ARG             TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
191500             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
           IF VEN-ITM-NO = 16
               MOVE VEN-PO-FOB TO SAVE-VEN-FOB
               MOVE VEN-PO-TERMS TO SAVE-VEN-TERMS
               GO TO 611-GET-DVENDOR.
           IF VEN-ITM-NO = 17
               PERFORM 611-MOVE-INSTR     THRU  611-MI-X.
191600     IF VEN-ITM-NO = 8
191700         MOVE "Y"  TO  VENDOR-ACT-RCD-EXISTS
191800         PERFORM 611-UPDATE-VENDOR  THRU  611-UV-X
191900     ELSE
192000     IF VEN-ITM-NO < 8
192100         PERFORM 611-UPDATE-VENDOR  THRU  611-UV-X
192200     ELSE
