       611-MOVE-INSTR.
           MOVE SPACES                TO  STANDARD-INSTRUCTIONS.
           MOVE 1                     TO  BEF-SUB  AFT-SUB.
           PERFORM VARYING INST-SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL INST-SUB > 4
               IF VEN-STD-INSTR (INST-SUB) > SPACES
                   IF VEN-BEFORE-AFTER (INST-SUB) = "B"
                       MOVE VEN-STD-INSTR (INST-SUB)
                                      TO  STD-INSTR-BEFORE (BEF-SUB)
                       ADD 1          TO  BEF-SUB
                   ELSE
                       MOVE VEN-STD-INSTR (INST-SUB)
                                      TO  STD-INSTR-AFTER  (AFT-SUB)
                       ADD 1          TO  AFT-SUB
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       611-MI-X.
           EXIT.

