271700****************************************************************
271800*    THIS SECTION CALL 'SPOSINST' WHICH BRINGS UP THE          *
271900*    STANDARD INSTRUCION SCREEN SO THE USER CAN SELECT         *
272000*    WHICH STANDARD INSTRUCTION THEY WANT TO PRINT ON THE PO.  *
272100*    THEN CALL 'SSIUPDT' TO UPDATE THE DATA BASE WITH THE      *
272200*    STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS SELECTED.                           *
272300****************************************************************
272400
272500 64-PROCESS-STD-INST.
272600     MOVE SPACES                  TO SPOSINST-PARMS.
           IF STANDARD-INSTRUCTIONS > SPACES
               MOVE STANDARD-INSTRUCTIONS  TO SPOSINST-STD-INST.
