DCR03
DCR03      MOVE "2"   TO WS-ZFOB-FOB-PGM-MODE.
DCR03      MOVE SPACE TO WS-ZFOB-FOB-ERR.
DCR03      MOVE DE3-FOB           TO WS-ZFOB-SAVE-FOB.
DCR03
DCR03      CALL WS-ZFOB-FOB-PGM  USING WS-ZFOB-FOB-PGM-MODE
DCR03                                  WS-ZFOB-FOB-CODE
DCR03                                  WS-ZFOB-FOB-DESC
DCR03                                  WS-ZFOB-FOB-ERR.
DCR03
DCR03
DCR03  ZFOB-READK-EXIT.
DCR03      EXIT.

